{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wishlist now!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/0d787730be33656286443c105cf4d9d7.poster.avif?t=1751571151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/0d787730be33656286443c105cf4d9d7.mp4?t=1751571151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Tactical domino placement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the highest possible score by expanding your domino web. Unfold the cosmic plane and optimise your domino placing route to collect as many resources as you can.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/a8806d42fe446e4902fe079290b1c17c.poster.avif?t=1751571151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/a8806d42fe446e4902fe079290b1c17c.mp4?t=1751571151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage the cosmic plane</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The bigger your domino web, the more vulnerable you become. Each turn the plane changes so you will have to improvise to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/249a661a289254b194a44b5fee4cfdb5.poster.avif?t=1751571151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/249a661a289254b194a44b5fee4cfdb5.mp4?t=1751571151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage your resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect cash, upgrade your deck and buy Nova Cards to create crazy synergies and tactical variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/48b0fdcf41410cd5c27abb5450733dcd.poster.avif?t=1751571151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/48b0fdcf41410cd5c27abb5450733dcd.mp4?t=1751571151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Satisfying visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a cosmic dance of colors and special effects. The higher you score, the more visually exciting the dance becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/ba1cb508ae2d97c8f6a20cb53c0229f6.poster.avif?t=1751571151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/ba1cb508ae2d97c8f6a20cb53c0229f6.mp4?t=1751571151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dynamic board elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the cosmic elements have an effect on eachother. Fire, explosives, ice, electricity, darkness, water and more. This makes every new playthrough dynamic and different.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 upgradable domino pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">150 unique Nova Cards that alter the game significantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 unlockable decks with each their own difficulty level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 unlockable challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daily playthroughs with leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive visual effects that will make you want to come back over and over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3399130?t=1751571151","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751571151","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/7b186e3333f46c00a7a6e9a13930a8fec2f9fe42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751571151","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/7b186e3333f46c00a7a6e9a13930a8fec2f9fe42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751571151","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wishlist now!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/0d787730be33656286443c105cf4d9d7.poster.avif?t=1751571151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/0d787730be33656286443c105cf4d9d7.mp4?t=1751571151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Tactical domino placement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the highest possible score by expanding your domino web. Unfold the cosmic plan